      "text": "From reference  74",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        185.97610473632812,
        786.8935546875,
        198.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "No study provided a comparison with 6 months of isoniazid. The study included 2.7% HIV-positive participants. Although the trial was conducted in low TB incidence countries, this is unlikely to affect the effect of RPT/isoniazid  a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        66.61419677734375,
        197.97610473632812,
        284.8679504394531,
        207.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "as compared with isoniazid monotherapy. Downgraded by one level.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        203.97610473632812,
        629.7359619140625,
        216.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "Although the 95% CI of the RR is wide, there were few events, and the CI of the absolute effect is narrow. The result also met pre-stated non-inferiority margin. Not downgraded.  b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        212.97610473632812,
        457.7850036621094,
        225.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "Although the 95% CI of the RR is wide, there were few events, and the CI of the absolute effect is narrow. Not downgraded.  c",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        221.97610473632812,
        388.514892578125,
        234.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "The open-label design of the trial may have introduced ascertainment bias. Downgraded by one level. d",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        230.97610473632812,
        607.69140625,
        243.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "Although the trial was open-label, this is unlikely to affect detection of hepatotoxicity, which is usually done by objective measurement (i.e. blood tests). Not downgraded.  e",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
